        // deliberately does NOT round trip. SV_OverlayPlayerStateToNative
        // carries only PlayerOtherFlagsServerOwnedMask into it, and the read
        // path never touches +0x10 at all -- after a native stage what sits
        // there is ciphertext, not flags, and reading it plaintext handed the
        // frame validator a different random otherFlags every frame.
        //
        // Asserting `result == source` over the whole struct therefore claimed
        // a symmetry this build does not have. It was also the weakest shape of
        // evidence available (sec 51j): a symmetric round trip cannot fail on a
        // field neither side touches. Assert the WRITE against the BUFFER, and
        // assert the missing read-back as the per-build fact it is.
        std::uint32_t rawNativeOtherFlags{};
